      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Sensei Sandy (Sandy José Núñez) is the founder and head coach of Sensei Sandy BJJ in Tannersville, NY. He is a first-degree Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu black belt under Professor Josh Griffiths at Clockwork Jiu-Jitsu in New York City.",
