    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Sandy has practiced martial arts since 2010 with thousands of hours coaching youth, teens, and adult beginners. A Greene County resident living in East Jewett, Sandy focuses on calm, cooperative learning, clear mechanical leverage, and safe beginner-first pacing. Active competitors, lifelong martial artists, and complete beginners train together in small classes capped at 12 students.",
